  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 925713254,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_11569-11635",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "11569-11635",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学会选择，常常就是学会放弃：选择一个，放弃其他。选择有时比努力重要，但放弃有时比选择更重要。我们应勇敢选择，然后享受好处，承担坏处。",
      "totalCount": 14448
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 396941778,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_3411-3454",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "3411-3454",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果自己有所损失，只能怪自己，也只有自己才能改变事情最终的结果——靠自己，自强者万强。",
      "totalCount": 12189
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 50174102,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_10145-10180",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "10145-10180",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "定力，是人生的智慧——最终的胜利，常常是时间的胜利，是长期主义的胜利。",
      "totalCount": 9990
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 1372011,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_1401-1452",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "1401-1452",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个人心中，应该有三种“对错观”：①法学家的对错观，②经济学家的对错观，③商人的对错观（见图1-1）。",
      "totalCount": 7657
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 596410319,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_3197-3212",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "3197-3212",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "总之，谁的损失大，就是谁的错。",
      "totalCount": 7308
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 437651025,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_54_2290-2303",
      "chapterUid": 54,
      "range": "2290-2303",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "底层逻辑+环境变量=方法论",
      "totalCount": 7238
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 89096083,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_11664-11692",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "11664-11692",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人生的悲剧，往往来自看着前方，又想着后方，最后无路可走。",
      "totalCount": 6784
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 415240508,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_974-1036",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "974-1036",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“课题分离”理论由奥地利心理学家阿尔弗雷德·阿德勒提出，原意指要解决人际关系的烦恼，就要区分什么是你的课题，什么是我的课题。",
      "totalCount": 6647
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 77859361,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_54_1948-2000",
      "chapterUid": 54,
      "range": "1948-2000",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "两个人发生争执的时候，一定是因为他们之间有更多的相同之处，而不是不同之处。完全不同的两个人是吵不起来的。",
      "totalCount": 6552
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 254205212,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_1298-1372",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "1298-1372",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "那怎么办？我要说“我的错，我的错”，然后心平气和地走到旁边。这是因为，我的时间比他的值钱，浪费同样的时间，我的损失大——“谁的损失大，就是谁的错”。",
      "totalCount": 6086
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 50174102,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_9157-9211",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "9157-9211",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "在一份工作中，你最想得到什么？最想学习、收获什么？它们才是你的目标。有些钱，是专门来诱惑我们放弃长远目标的。",
      "totalCount": 5170
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 331539408,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_2097-2176",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "2097-2176",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这就是立场——“我们不争对错，只争输赢”。所以，不要和有立场的人争对错。这也是我们常说的“小孩子才谈对错，成年人只谈利益”。为什么？因为小孩子没有位置和利益。",
      "totalCount": 4905
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 384604587,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_2808-2850",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "2808-2850",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "反过来，我们也要时刻反省自己：我说的话、我的表述，是事实，是观点，是立场，还是信仰？",
      "totalCount": 4862
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 331539408,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_8986-9049",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "8986-9049",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "在生活中，最容易让我们迷失的，往往是金钱。我常说，在35岁之前不要在乎自己的收入是多少钱，成长了多少才是我们最应该关注的收入。",
      "totalCount": 4632
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 64168450,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_5887-5923",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "5887-5923",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你想把什么想法注射到别人脑中，把它放在“为什么”这三个字后面，就可以了。",
      "totalCount": 4560
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 227324513,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_20938-20954",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "20938-20954",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "流量，改变存量。存量，改变世界。",
      "totalCount": 4524
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 37162305,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_65_3296-3317",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "3296-3317",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "判断损失发生后应该怪谁，就看谁因此损失大。",
      "totalCount": 4248
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 304012195,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_67_12944-12987",
      "chapterUid": 67,
      "range": "12944-12987",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "很多人都是这样吧，间歇性踌躇满志，持续性混吃等死，改变太难，还是吃鸡、打王者比较简单。",
      "totalCount": 4224
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 5772175,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_6157-6181",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "6157-6181",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "把谣言放在“为什么”后面，是传播谣言的最佳方法。",
      "totalCount": 4199
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300011622",
      "userVid": 208435722,
      "bookmarkId": "3300011622_66_29800-29860",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "29800-29860",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "普通的人改变结果，优秀的人改变原因，顶级优秀的人改变模型。改变制度是改变结果，改变流程是改变原因，改变系统则是改变模型。",
      "totalCount": 4081
    }
  ],
